	(text "04 - Motor Drivers\n4 x DRV8830 I2C H-bridges, one per motor, addresses 0x60/61/62/64 by A1/A0.\nCommanded by the Vision board's P4 over the stack I2C. nFAULT wire-ORs\ninto MOT_INT (10 k to 3V3). ISENSE 0.5 ohm = 400 mA limit per motor.\nVCC is the battery rail through Q3 (VMOT), 10 uF + 100 nF at each chip." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 25 0)
